## The state at the start of this role

The worktree held the uncommitted production work of an earlier Green session:
the message line of review-run.sh, judge-run.sh, and the new judges.json.
The Red commits dd57da7 and 07418d2 are inside phase_base_sha..role_base_sha.
The Red change is the committed Red test file, so it stays untouched here.

## The change

1. judge-run.sh reads judges.json only. The routes.json fallback is gone, and a
   missing judges.json file is a refusal: exit 2, one judge-run: line, no call,
   and no judge file. The judge rows hold no kind field, so the kind check runs
   only for a row that holds one.
2. The new tool harness/model-guide/seed-messages.ts reads the key of every
   diff, asks gh for the commit message, and writes the first line to
   messages/<diff_id>.txt. It writes every file only after every message is
   known, so a refusal leaves no message file.
3. review-run.sh reads the message file of every diff and puts the line
   between the prompt and the seeded diff. A missing or empty message file is
   a refusal before the lock and before any call.

